### IntelliJ / VS Code REST Client. Basic auth = dev users from application-dev.yml
@base = http://localhost:8080

### Open wallets
POST {{base}}/api/wallets
Authorization: Basic alice alice-dev

###
POST {{base}}/api/wallets
Authorization: Basic bob bob-dev

### Deposit (simulated M-Pesa top-up). Re-send with the same key: balance does not change.
POST {{base}}/api/wallets/me/deposits
Authorization: Basic alice alice-dev
Idempotency-Key: dep-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 50000.00 }

### Send money (202 Accepted, settles asynchronously)
POST {{base}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Basic alice alice-dev
Idempotency-Key: trf-00000001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "recipient": "bob", "amount": 1200.00, "note": "lunch at Java House" }

### Large transfer (>= KES 20,000 scores 35) -> expect IN_REVIEW
POST {{base}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Basic alice alice-dev
Idempotency-Key: trf-00000002
Content-Type: application/json

{ "recipient": "bob", "amount": 21000.00, "note": "rent" }

### My transfers
GET {{base}}/api/transfers
Authorization: Basic alice alice-dev

### Statement
GET {{base}}/api/wallets/me/statement
Authorization: Basic alice alice-dev

### Analyst review queue
GET {{base}}/api/admin/transfers/review-queue
Authorization: Basic admin admin-dev

### Approve a held transfer (replace id)
POST {{base}}/api/admin/transfers/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/approve
Authorization: Basic admin admin-dev

### Spending insights + LLM narrative
GET {{base}}/api/insights/me/narrative
Authorization: Basic alice alice-dev

### Anomaly alerts
GET {{base}}/api/anomalies/me
Authorization: Basic alice alice-dev

### Ask the assistant (RAG + tools)
POST {{base}}/api/assistant/ask
Authorization: Basic alice alice-dev
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Why might my transfer be in review, and what did I spend most on this month?" }

### Module structure, event publications (dev exposes all actuator endpoints)
GET {{base}}/actuator/modulith
Authorization: Basic admin admin-dev

### ===================== Lending =====================

### Loan products
GET {{base}}/api/loans/products
Authorization: Basic alice alice-dev

### Sub-agent otieno originates a KES 3,000 loan for alice (202, decided async)
POST {{base}}/api/agents/me/loans
Authorization: Basic otieno otieno-dev
Idempotency-Key: loan-00000001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "borrower": "alice", "productCode": "SOKO-28", "principal": 3000.00 }

### Alice sees her loan, schedule and score
GET {{base}}/api/loans
Authorization: Basic alice alice-dev

### Alice repays KES 850 from her wallet (waterfall: fee -> interest -> principal)
POST {{base}}/api/loans/REPLACE-LOAN-ID/repayments
Authorization: Basic alice alice-dev
Idempotency-Key: rep-00000001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 850.00 }

### Otieno collects KES 500 cash for the same loan (debits his float)
POST {{base}}/api/agents/me/collections
Authorization: Basic otieno otieno-dev
Idempotency-Key: col-00000001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "loanId": "REPLACE-LOAN-ID", "amount": 500.00 }

### Wanjiru's portfolio rolls up otieno's book (recursive CTE) incl. PAR30 and her commission
GET {{base}}/api/agents/me/portfolio
Authorization: Basic wanjiru wanjiru-dev

### Wanjiru's network
GET {{base}}/api/agents/me/network
Authorization: Basic wanjiru wanjiru-dev

### Fast-forward: run end-of-day for a date 20 days ahead -> installments go OVERDUE, penalties accrue
POST {{base}}/api/admin/lending/jobs/eod?date=2026-12-01
Authorization: Basic admin admin-dev

### Whole-book portfolio
GET {{base}}/api/admin/lending/portfolio
Authorization: Basic admin admin-dev

### Credit review queue
GET {{base}}/api/admin/lending/review-queue
Authorization: Basic admin admin-dev

### Ask the assistant about loans (RAG policy + myLoans tool)
POST {{base}}/api/assistant/ask
Authorization: Basic alice alice-dev
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "When is my next loan installment and how can I borrow more next time?" }

### ===================== Search (OpenSearch read model, dev profile) =====================
### Indexing is async (~1s). Dashboards Dev Tools: http://localhost:5601/app/dev_tools#/console

### Full text: stemmed + fuzzy ("lunches", "lnch") and as-you-type ("jav") all find "lunch at Java House"
GET {{base}}/api/admin/search/transfers?q=jav
Authorization: Basic admin admin-dev

### Filters + facets: completed transfers between 500 and 5,000 KES this month
GET {{base}}/api/admin/search/transfers?status=completed&minAmount=500&maxAmount=5000&from=2026-11-01
Authorization: Basic admin admin-dev

### Everything involving one user
GET {{base}}/api/admin/search/transfers?party=alice
Authorization: Basic admin admin-dev

### A user searches only their own transfers (scoped server-side)
GET {{base}}/api/search/transfers?q=lunch
Authorization: Basic bob bob-dev

### Loan book: per-status counts with principal and repaid sums
GET {{base}}/api/admin/search/loans
Authorization: Basic admin admin-dev

### Loans of one borrower
GET {{base}}/api/admin/search/loans?borrower=alice
Authorization: Basic admin admin-dev

